.TH "PB-CONFIG-TEAM-DEFAULT-SET" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-config-team-default-set - Set a team's default pull repository


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb config team-default-set <team> <repository> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Set a team's default pull repository

.PP
Set a team's default pull repository for members who explicitly adopt it. This changes the team default, not every member's current local assignment.

.PP
Configuration commands distinguish local CLI settings from synchronized repository content. Inspect current state before changing it; synchronization reports conflicts instead of silently overwriting one side. The --json option provides structured output for scripts where supported.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for team-default-set

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-config(1)\fP
